      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to add approximately 2 at% Al while retaining equiatomic proportions among Hf, Nb, Ta, Ti, and Zr in the balance.",
